<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-16T11:50:32.210Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:50:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian fishermen who survived U.S. drone strikes at sea have filed lawsuits accusing the United States of unlawful attacks, kidnapping and torture, while the president denies any U.S. military base in the country. Prison gangs continue to run drug trafficking operations, exemplified by a man sentenced for fentanyl and heroin offenses, and reports describe the nation turning into a narco state dominated by gang-controlled trafficking. Violence against civilians persists, with a journalist murdered outside his home, two local election candidates shot dead in El Oro, and a priest killed when a crucifix fell during mass. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPUkF6QTdlZlB3NDJJbVZ4VnVLSUdhcFF4WjRSOFpoWkhMcnc3RVZtZFE1OGQ5bWZQdHlxWlR0RFgxS1RobTY0RHhkUEpySm1NSVBQbnRnVDgzX2tYbkNpTU5YQXl4UmF0X2o4R3NqMjhsYWhHTk9oVTVtZ2oxbnV6UlFOcmpWdFkyU2cxX3huU21IUkhzLXRkRmpCMEtCYTJ3NWRN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPQVM2SEVWUXlCWC1sdTJqWlJ5Tm8wTUVmYW12UHRHZF81eGtTZ25sWWVoYXRZNVIxOWt3QVFjdmU4WndCblZKUE1Nd3h6U09aUWRMOExaQ25pMjU5OFFVMFZRYUJWMk1TMk0xMWI2LUpWcVZ3TUpwNlc3TExkR3dJSUUwOFBvRDliV3pRNWEzd0dLQUlSQmVoVVZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQdDY1eF93ZEhONTVkU0tKb1NtbzZuaWFFOU92UEtiaW5sclFjSDhIN1FBVmU2VXZ0TTh0bm1XYURKa1c5b24tMGx3WGM2SWZTVkhXdjQyU2V2VktPR054WHBaQUs0MHZtMEVFVldWdlZwcldWZzdPU05URlF4NllqUWNqNmNmcGg4MWhtVkhWajVqaE1CeFF0dVQ3RW9SWXppbk9BcmF0QzZPMmk0OE5KeDdLdXM3cE9UXy1SWm9sUkUxSGhSWnE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV